            "excerpt": "# Unresolved migration rollback note\n\nUNRESOLVED CONFLICT: this migration note says checkout rollback is prohibited because a schema migration might be irreversible. It conflicts with the current sandbox release runbook. No schema-migration verification is attached. When this passage applies to the incident and remains unresolved, seek clarification from checkout-operations and escalate instead of silently selecting the more convenient instruction.",
